{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/c95a7c4c8a986966927fee4b5d3a5a25.avif?t=1762359283\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freelancers: Rogue Skies</strong> is an <strong>open-world, single-player space combat rogue lite</strong>\u00a0where every pilot is expendable and each death births a new story. Take control of ARC\u2011700 starfighters and dive into fast-paced dogfights across a handcrafted galaxy wracked by war between the UEG and Fringe Colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa High\u2011octane 3rd\u2011person combat</strong> <br>Master agile dogfighting. Dodge and strike like a real pilot. Enemy AI flank, evade, and hunt with ruthless precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.poster.avif?t=1762359283\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.webm?t=1762359283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.mp4?t=1762359283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Permadeath with purpose</strong><br>When your ship explodes, press R to respawn as a new freelancer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Fully open-world galaxy</strong><br>Fly freely between space systems, convoy battles, derelict hauls, and surprise ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.poster.avif?t=1762359283\" width=780 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.webm?t=1762359283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.mp4?t=1762359283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Emergent stories run by you</strong><br>Fight for the UEG, go rogue, or blaze your own path. Every run is a narrative you craft: the pilot histories, battles survived, and legends born in space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/f4fcfa56f3b8d8fcce9b19ce7d2913ae.avif?t=1762359283\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Run Is A New Freelancer</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Dogfights</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Persistent Power</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic-Only Variants</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Faction Conflict</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896030/4345a073741b0338d99344d658be7345e33f3fd9.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896030/7b4599f2697451d65e99052d554a9e4cfb014a9f.jpg"},{"name":"Hot, Hot, Hot!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896030/c9f4b108e50307ff4b8495f2d64b97031c79bc1e.jpg"},{"name":"Kill Commander Cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu